{"v":1,"book":"Judg","ch":2,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then the Angel of Jehovah went up from Gilgal to Bochim. And He said, I caused you to go up out from Egypt, and I brought you into the land that I swore to your fathers. And I said, I will never break My covenant with you,","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"Angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Gilgal","s":["H1537"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Bochim","s":["H1066"],"a":[6]},{"t":". And He "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", I caused you to go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[8]},{"t":" out from "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[10]},{"t":", and I "},{"t":"brought","s":["H0935"],"a":[11]},{"t":" you into the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[14]},{"t":" that I "},{"t":"swore","s":["H7650"],"a":[16]},{"t":" to your "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[17]},{"t":". And I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[18]},{"t":", I will "},{"t":"never","s":["H5769"],"a":[23]},{"t":" "},{"t":"break","s":["H6565"],"a":[20]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[21]},{"t":" with you,"}]},{"n":2,"text":"And you shall not make a covenant with the inhabitants of this land; you shall tear down their altars. But you did not listen to My voice. What is this that you have done?","tok":[{"t":"And you shall not "},{"t":"make","s":["H3772"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of this "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; you shall tear "},{"t":"down","s":["H5422"],"a":[8]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"altars","s":["H4196"],"a":[7]},{"t":". But you did not listen to My "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[11]},{"t":". What is this that you have "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[14]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Therefore I also said, I will not drive them out from before you; but they will be like thorns in your sides, and their gods will be a snare to you.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I also "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", I will not drive them "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you; but they will be like thorns in your "},{"t":"sides","s":["H6654"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and their "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[9]},{"t":" will be a "},{"t":"snare","s":["H4170"],"a":[12]},{"t":" to you."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And when the Angel of Jehovah had spoken these words to all the children of Israel, the people lifted up their voice and wept.","tok":[{"t":"And when the "},{"t":"Angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" had spoken these "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to all the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[10]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[12]},{"t":" lifted "},{"t":"up","s":["H5375"],"a":[11]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"wept","s":["H1058"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And they called the name of that place Bochim. And they offered to Jehovah there.","tok":[{"t":"And they "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of that "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Bochim","s":["H1066"],"a":[4]},{"t":". And they offered to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" there."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Now when Joshua sent the people away, each of the children of Israel went to his own inheritance to possess the land.","tok":[{"t":"Now when "},{"t":"Joshua","s":["H3091"],"a":[1]},{"t":" sent the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" away, each of the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to his own "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"possess","s":["H3423"],"a"